  "narrative": "The newly released validations substantially strengthen the central dataset associations and close their main investigations. H6 now has both discovery and independent validation under the negative-direction feature_037 claim: the signed validation estimate is +0.845, with a strict independent interval from +0.752 to +0.939. Because the hypothesis direction is negative, this corresponds to a raw feature_037=1 minus feature_037=0 contrast of about -0.845 composite dependency-score units, i.e. lower outcome_001 and stronger dependency. The interval is far beyond the 0.15-unit threshold, so H6 is accepted and closed. H14 is also accepted and closed. Within feature_037=0 individuals, independent validation of the positive feature_010 contrast is +0.384 raw units, interval +0.241 to +0.527. This confirms that the feature_010 positive association is not driven only by the feature_037=1 stratum; it persists and is scientifically meaningful among feature_037=0 individuals. H35 is now accepted and closed. The positive feature_002 claim has independent validation estimate +0.826 raw units, interval +0.735 to +0.917, confirming that feature_002=1 is associated with higher outcome_001 and weaker dependency. The same validation contrast also supports rejection of the earlier negative-direction H18. Together with H6 and H13, this gives three validated large main-effect contrasts: feature_037=1 lowers outcome_001, while feature_010=1 and feature_002=1 raise outcome_001. The conditional persistence tests already accepted show that these associations are not merely simple overlap or coding inversion among the tested predictor strata. The next highest-information issue is therefore effect modification and additivity among feature_002, feature_037, and feature_010. I have registered additional non-sparse direct conditional strata that complete the 2-by-2-by-2 pattern except for the all-positive triple cell, which appears too sparse to estimate validly. These tests, together with active interactions H40, H41, H42, H44, and H45, will indicate whether the three main effects approximate an additive joint association or whether the association structure is heterogeneity. All claims remain supplied-dataset associations, not causal effects, biological mechanisms, or generalizable findings.",
  "research_notes": "Current supported dataset associations: H6 accepted/closed and independently validated: feature_037=1 lowers outcome_001 / stronger dependency, raw about -0.83 to -0.85. H13 accepted/closed and independently validated: feature_010=1 raises outcome_001 / weaker dependency, raw about +0.42 discovery and +0.36 validation. H14 accepted/closed and independently validated: feature_010 effect persists among feature_037=0, raw about +0.44 discovery and +0.38 validation. H35 accepted/closed and independently validated: feature_002=1 raises outcome_001 / weaker dependency, raw about +0.83 discovery and +0.83 validation; H18 remains rejected. Conditional persistence accepted: H46, H36-H39, H43, H49-H50 for feature_002; H47-H48, H51-H52, H15/H24, H23 for feature_037/feature_010. Interpretation: three large binary associations in this dataset are robust in main and many conditional strata, not simple overlap/coding inversion among tested strata. Limitations: descriptive dataset associations; no causal/mechanistic/generalizable claims; triple all-positive cell feature_002=1 feature_037=1 feature_010=1 is only about 19 and cannot be used as a valid three-way mean cell; conditional estimates overlap and do not prove additive independent effects. Negative: H1-H4, H7, H8-H12, H16-H22, H25. Near-threshold H20/H21 not promoted. Next priority: analyze formal interactions/additivity among feature_002, feature_037, feature_010: active H40, H41, H42, H44, H45 plus newly proposed non-sparse direct conditional strata (feature_037 in feature_002=0 feature_010=1 and feature_002=1 feature_010=0; feature_010 in feature_002=1 feature_037=0 and feature_002=0 feature_037=1). Do not propose all-positive triple. If interactions are null/small, treat the validated main effects as approximate dataset additive associations. If large, report conditional heterogeneity and possibly seek validation of modified stratum estimates. After that, reopen deferred broad binary screens H28-H34 and feature_037 signature interactions H26-H27, and consider categorical screens only where comparator cells are expected sufficient."
