  "research_notes": "Updated accepted descriptive supplied-dataset claims: (1) feature_037=1 lowers outcome_001; (2) feature_002=1 and feature_010=1 raise outcome_001; (3) feature_063=1 lowers outcome_001 mainly when feature_037=0 and feature_010=0, with accepted context effects including H87/H61/H90/H68/H95/H96/H93/H105 and validated H103. H103 validation: signed +0.492 [0.257,0.728], fully above threshold; accepted and closed. H105 closed after accepted direct high-feature_038 mean effect. H67 validation: signed +0.369 [0.146,0.593], point above threshold but validation lower bound marginally below threshold; combined with discovery supports accepting H67. H94 null low-feature_038 complement helps distinguish feature_038 context modification from sparse subgroup noise. Negative/rejected: broad feature_007/058/015/041 main effects; H104 broad long-log-PFS feature_063 interaction; H107 feature_036 feature_063 interaction; H106 as originally hypothesized feature_018 high-context effect; H40/H44/H45 dominant-marker additivity tests mostly null. Unresolved active: H110 reversed feature_018 interaction (+0.272 [0.099,0.445]); H108/H109 dominant-marker attenuation interactions; H41 feature_002-by-feature_010 interaction (+0.210 [0.019,0.400]); H66 overall feature_063 marginal diluted by null contexts. Next priorities: analyze H111/H112 to resolve feature_018 direct strata; then H97-H102 for logPFS robustness of central markers; H41 follow-up only if capacity remains. Do not chase overlapping feature_063 context validations unless needed; H103 already validates the key feature_038 interaction. All conclusions remain descriptive dataset associations, not causal, biological, mechanistic, or generalizable."
