uation high feature_038 +0.101 [-0.175,0.376]; H108/H109 broad attenuation wide; H41 feature_002-by-feature_010 +0.210 [0.019,0.400]; H66 overall feature_063 diluted; H88/H89 broader feature_063 contexts; H102 long log-pfs feature_010 +0.290 [0.068,0.511]; H99/H100 pending; H118 accepted but sparse feature_037=1/feature_038 interaction needs direct confirmation. Next analyze priorities: H119/H120 direct feature_063 within feature_037=1/high and low feature_038, new H121 direct feature_063 within high feature_038/feature_037=0, then H99/H100 feature_002 log-pfs robustness, then H41 follow-up if capacity. Do not treat overall H66 or H110 as accepted threshold claims. All conclusions descriptive supplied-dataset associations, not causal, biological, mechanistic, or generalizable."
