d feature_037 are fixed. The fourth proposal directly tests feature_010 higher-score association among positive feature_038 and nonpositive feature_018. Accepted interaction H224 indicates feature_010 differs by feature_018 in high feature_038, accepted H222 supports the top-feature_038/low-feature_018 direct contrast, and active H230 targets positive feature_038/high feature_018. This new direct positive-feature_038/low-feature_018 contrast tests whether low feature_018 rescues the feature_010 higher-score association at a lower feature_038 threshold. The expected direction is higher outcome_001; the meaningful-null alternative is attenuation. All estimates and intervals returned for these claims will already be signed to the registered claim direction. I will accept a new association only if the signed point estimate and full 95% Welch interval clearly indicate a raw absolute difference exceeding 0.15 outcome_001 units in the claimed direction. Insufficient-cell diagnostics will be treated as inconclusive rather than negative. All conclusions are descriptive supplied-dataset associations only, not causal, mechanistic, single-gene knockout, biological, or generalizable claims.",
